#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:4
msgid "有限鎖の準位と有限サイズギャップ"
msgstr "Finite-Chain Levels and the Finite-Size Gap"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:6
msgid ""
"分子や有限の長さの鎖を計算すると、準位は離散的で、最高被占有軌道（HOMO）と "
"最低空軌道（LUMO）の間に隙間（HOMO–LUMOギャップ）が開く。この隙間が結晶のバンドギャップに "
"対応するのか、原子数が有限であるために生じたものなのかは、ギャップの大きさだけでは決まらない。 本稿では、\\ "
":ref:`タイト・バインディング近似<tightbinding>`\\ の1次元鎖を両端が開いた境界条件で解き、 "
"離散準位が周期鎖のバンドとどう対応するか、ギャップが原子数と境界条件でどう変わるかを確かめる。"
msgstr ""
"Calculations for molecules and finite chains give discrete levels, with a"
" gap between the highest occupied molecular orbital (HOMO) and the lowest"
" unoccupied molecular orbital (LUMO). The size of this HOMO–LUMO gap "
"alone cannot tell us whether it corresponds to a crystal's band gap or "
"arises from the finite number of atoms. We solve the one-dimensional "
"chain in the \\ :ref:`tight-binding approximation <tightbinding>`\\  with"
" both ends open and examine how its discrete levels correspond to the "
"periodic-chain band and how the gap depends on the number of atoms and "
"the boundary conditions."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:12
msgid ""
"本稿では、両端が開いた :math:`N` 原子の鎖を **開放端の鎖**、:math:`N` 原子に周期境界条件を 課した鎖（環）を "
"**有限の周期鎖** と呼ぶ。両者を合わせて有限鎖と呼ぶ。"
msgstr ""
"We call a chain of :math:`N` atoms with both ends open an **open-ended "
"chain**, and a chain of :math:`N` atoms with periodic boundary conditions"
" (a ring) a **finite periodic chain**. We refer to both as finite chains."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:15
msgid ""
"**前提知識**: :ref:`タイト・バインディング近似<tightbinding>`\\ の模型（式 :eq:`tb-"
"recursion`、:eq:`tb-band`）、 :ref:`半充填<half-filling>`、:ref:`SSH模型<tb-ssh>`。"
msgstr ""
"**Prerequisites**: The model in the :ref:`tight-binding approximation "
"<tightbinding>`\\  (Equations :eq:`tb-recursion` and :eq:`tb-band`), "
":ref:`half filling <half-filling>`, and the :ref:`SSH model <tb-ssh>`."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:18
msgid "**学習目標**:"
msgstr "**Learning objectives**:"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:20
msgid "開放端の鎖の固有状態を求め、擬似波数の意味を説明する。"
msgstr ""
"Find the eigenstates of an open-ended chain and explain what "
"pseudowavenumbers represent."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:21
msgid "半充填の開放端の鎖のHOMO–LUMOギャップが、原子数が大きいとき、およそ原子数に反比例して閉じることを示す。"
msgstr ""
"Show that the HOMO–LUMO gap of a half-filled open-ended chain closes "
"approximately in inverse proportion to the number of atoms when the "
"number of atoms is large."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:22
msgid "計算で得たギャップが、有限サイズによるものか、無限鎖でも残るものかを、原子数と境界条件への依存から判断する。"
msgstr ""
"Use the dependence on the number of atoms and the boundary conditions to "
"determine whether a calculated gap arises from finite size or persists in"
" the infinite chain."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:27
msgid "開放端の境界条件"
msgstr "Open Boundary Conditions"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:29
msgid ""
"開放端の鎖では、:math:`n=1` と :math:`n=N` の原子は片側に しか隣接原子をもたない。これは、仮想的な "
":math:`n=0` と :math:`n=N+1` の位置に 係数0の軌道を置き、"
msgstr ""
"In an open-ended chain, the atoms at :math:`n=1` and :math:`n=N` have a "
"neighbor on only one side. This is equivalent to placing orbitals with "
"zero coefficients at the fictitious positions :math:`n=0` and "
":math:`n=N+1` and imposing the boundary condition"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:33
#, python-brace-format
msgid "c_0=c_{N+1}=0"
msgstr "c_0=c_{N+1}=0"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:38
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"という境界条件で\\ :ref:`タイト・バインディング近似<tightbinding>`\\ の連立方程式 :eq:`tb-recursion`"
" を解くことと同じである。 これを **開放境界条件** と呼ぶ。周期境界条件 :math:`c_{n+N}=c_n` と違い、並進 "
":math:`n\\to n+1` は 鎖を自分自身に重ねないので、ブロッホ和は固有状態にならない。"
msgstr ""
"when solving the system of equations in the \\ :ref:`tight-binding "
"approximation <tightbinding>`\\ , Equation :eq:`tb-recursion`. These are "
"called **open boundary conditions**. With the periodic boundary condition"
" :math:`c_{n+N}=c_n` the chain maps onto itself under translation, but "
"with open boundaries the translation :math:`n\\to n+1` does not. Thus "
"Bloch sums are not eigenstates of the open-ended chain."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:45
msgid "定在波と擬似波数"
msgstr "Standing Waves and Pseudowavenumbers"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:47
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"周期鎖の進行波 :math:`e^{\\pm ikna}` を重ね合わせた定在波 :math:`c_n=\\sin(n\\theta)` を "
"試すと、"
msgstr ""
"With the periodic chain’s traveling waves :math:`e^{\\pm ikna}` "
"superposed into the trial standing wave :math:`c_n=\\sin(n\\theta)`, the "
"identity"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:50
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"c_{n+1}+c_{n-1}=\\sin\\bigl((n+1)\\theta\\bigr)+\\sin\\bigl((n-1)\\theta\\bigr)"
"\n"
"=2\\cos\\theta\\,\\sin(n\\theta)"
msgstr ""
"c_{n+1}+c_{n-1}=\\sin\\bigl((n+1)\\theta\\bigr)+\\sin\\bigl((n-1)\\theta\\bigr)"
"\n"
"=2\\cos\\theta\\,\\sin(n\\theta)"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:55
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"より :math:`E=\\varepsilon_0-2t\\cos\\theta` を得る。:math:`c_0=0` は自動的に "
"満たされ、:math:`c_{N+1}=\\sin\\bigl((N+1)\\theta\\bigr)=0` から :math:`\\theta`"
" は"
msgstr ""
"gives :math:`E=\\varepsilon_0-2t\\cos\\theta`. The condition "
":math:`c_0=0` is automatic, and "
":math:`c_{N+1}=\\sin\\bigl((N+1)\\theta\\bigr)=0` quantizes "
":math:`\\theta` according to"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:58
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\theta_j=\\frac{j\\pi}{N+1},\\qquad j=1,\\ldots,N"
msgstr "\\theta_j=\\frac{j\\pi}{N+1},\\qquad j=1,\\ldots,N"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:62
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"に量子化される。:math:`\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\sin^2(n\\theta_j)=(N+1)/2` を使って "
"規格化すると、固有ベクトルと固有値は"
msgstr ""
"Normalizing with :math:`\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\sin^2(n\\theta_j)=(N+1)/2` gives"
" the eigenvectors and eigenvalues"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:65
msgid "\\phi_j(n)=\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{N+1}}\\sin\\left(\\frac{nj\\pi}{N+1}\\right),"
msgstr "\\phi_j(n)=\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{N+1}}\\sin\\left(\\frac{nj\\pi}{N+1}\\right),"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:70
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"E_j=\\varepsilon_0-2t\\cos\\left(\\frac{j\\pi}{N+1}\\right),\\qquad "
"j=1,\\ldots,N"
msgstr ""
"E_j=\\varepsilon_0-2t\\cos\\left(\\frac{j\\pi}{N+1}\\right),\\qquad "
"j=1,\\ldots,N"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:75
msgid "となる。"
msgstr "respectively."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:79
msgid ""
":eq:`tb-open-levels` は、周期鎖の分散 :eq:`tb-band` に :math:`k_ja=j\\pi/(N+1)` "
"を代入した形をしている。この :math:`k_j` を開放端の鎖の **擬似波数** と呼ぶ。開放端の鎖は並進対称性をもたないので "
":math:`k_j` は厳密な 量子数ではないが、:eq:`tb-open-vec` が示すように、:math:`j` 番目の固有状態は 波数 "
":math:`k_j` で空間的に振動する定在波である。:math:`N` を増やすと :math:`k_j` は "
":math:`0<ka<\\pi` を細かく埋め、準位の集合は周期鎖のバンドに 近づく。"
msgstr ""
"Equation :eq:`tb-open-levels` has the form of the periodic-chain "
"dispersion in Equation :eq:`tb-band` with :math:`k_ja=j\\pi/(N+1)` "
"substituted. We call :math:`k_j` the **pseudowavenumber** of the open-"
"ended chain. The open-ended chain lacks translational symmetry, so "
":math:`k_j` is not an exact quantum number. But as Equation :eq:`tb-open-"
"vec` shows, eigenstate number :math:`j` is a standing wave that "
"oscillates in space with wave number :math:`k_j`. As :math:`N` increases,"
" the values of :math:`k_j` fill :math:`0<ka<\\pi` more densely, and the "
"set of levels approaches the periodic-chain band."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:87
msgid ""
"定在波は :math:`+k` と :math:`-k` の進行波を重ねた形をしている。 :math:`k_j` "
"の符号を反転すると定在波全体の符号が変わるので、独立な状態には 正の擬似波数だけを割り当てればよい。開放端で許される擬似波数は "
":math:`j=1,\\ldots,N` に対応するため、固有状態の数は周期鎖と同じ :math:`N` 個である。"
msgstr ""
"A standing wave is a superposition of traveling waves with :math:`+k` and"
" :math:`-k`. Reversing the sign of :math:`k_j` changes the sign of the "
"entire standing wave, so only positive pseudowavenumbers are needed to "
"label independent states. The allowed pseudowavenumbers for an open-ended"
" chain correspond to :math:`j=1,\\ldots,N`, so there are :math:`N` "
"eigenstates, the same number as in the periodic chain."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:95
msgid "開放端の鎖のHOMO–LUMOギャップ"
msgstr "HOMO–LUMO Gap of an Open-Ended Chain"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:97
msgid ""
"開放端の鎖で :math:`N` が偶数、半充填のとき、:math:`j=1,\\ldots,N/2` の準位が占有される。 HOMOは "
":math:`j=N/2`、LUMOは :math:`j=N/2+1` なので、その差は"
msgstr ""
"For a half-filled open-ended chain with even :math:`N`, the levels "
":math:`j=1,\\ldots,N/2` are occupied. The HOMO is :math:`j=N/2` and the "
"LUMO is :math:`j=N/2+1`, so their difference is"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:101
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\Delta_N=E_{N/2+1}-E_{N/2}\n"
"=2t\\left[\\cos\\frac{N\\pi}{2(N+1)}-\\cos\\frac{(N+2)\\pi}{2(N+1)}\\right]"
msgstr ""
"\\Delta_N=E_{N/2+1}-E_{N/2}\n"
"=2t\\left[\\cos\\frac{N\\pi}{2(N+1)}-\\cos\\frac{(N+2)\\pi}{2(N+1)}\\right]"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:106
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"である。和積公式 :math:`\\cos A-\\cos B=2\\sin\\frac{A+B}{2}\\sin\\frac{B-A}{2}` "
"に :math:`A+B=\\pi`、:math:`B-A=\\pi/(N+1)` を使うと"
msgstr ""
"Applying the sum-to-product identity :math:`\\cos A-\\cos "
"B=2\\sin\\frac{A+B}{2}\\sin\\frac{B-A}{2}` with :math:`A+B=\\pi` and "
":math:`B-A=\\pi/(N+1)` gives"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:109
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\Delta_N=4t\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2(N+1)}\\right)\n"
"\\simeq\\frac{2\\pi t}{N+1}\\qquad(N\\gg1)"
msgstr ""
"\\Delta_N=4t\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2(N+1)}\\right)\n"
"\\simeq\\frac{2\\pi t}{N+1}\\qquad(N\\gg1)"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:115
msgid ""
"を得る。開放端の等間隔鎖では、有限の長さで準位が離散的になるため、HOMOとLUMOの間に 隙間が生じる。この **有限サイズギャップ** "
"は大きな :math:`N` でおよそ :math:`1/N` に比例し、 無限鎖の極限でゼロになる。"
msgstr ""
"In an equally spaced open-ended chain, the finite length makes the levels"
" discrete, leaving a gap between the HOMO and LUMO. This **finite-size "
"gap** scales, for large :math:`N`, approximately as :math:`1/N` and "
"vanishes in the infinite-chain limit."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:119
msgid ""
"開放端の鎖の準位全体の幅は :math:`E_N-E_1=4t\\cos\\bigl(\\pi/(N+1)\\bigr)` であり、 "
":math:`N\\to\\infty` で\\ :ref:`バンド幅<band-width>` :math:`4t` に近づく。:eq:`tb-"
"finite-gap` と 準位の幅は、計算で得た有限鎖の準位から有効的なホッピング :math:`t` を 見積もる手がかりになる。"
msgstr ""
"The full spread of the open-ended chain's levels is "
":math:`E_N-E_1=4t\\cos\\bigl(\\pi/(N+1)\\bigr)`. As :math:`N\\to\\infty`,"
" it approaches the \\ :ref:`bandwidth <band-width>` :math:`4t`. Equation "
":eq:`tb-finite-gap` and the spread of the levels can help estimate the "
"effective hopping :math:`t` from calculated finite-chain levels."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:127
msgid "有限の周期鎖との比較"
msgstr "Comparison with a Finite Periodic Chain"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:129
msgid ""
"有限の周期鎖の準位は :eq:`tb-band` の離散的な点 :math:`k=2\\pi m/(Na)` に乗る。 "
"半充填では、:math:`N` を4で割った余りによってギャップが変わる。 :math:`N=4n+2` の場合、無限鎖の正の\\ "
":ref:`フェルミ波数<fermi-wavenumber>` :math:`\\pi/(2a)` の両隣の波数は "
":math:`\\pi/(2a)\\pm\\pi/(Na)` である。式 :eq:`tb-band` に代入すると、 "
"最高被占有準位と最低空準位の差は :math:`\\Delta_N=4t\\sin(\\pi/N)` となる。 例えば :math:`N=6` で"
" :math:`2t` になる。大きな :math:`N` では :math:`\\Delta_N\\simeq4\\pi t/N` "
"で、同じ原子数の開放端のギャップの約2倍である。"
msgstr ""
"The levels of a finite periodic chain lie at discrete points of Equation "
":eq:`tb-band` with :math:`k=2\\pi m/(Na)`. At half filling, the gap "
"depends on the remainder when :math:`N` is divided by four. If "
":math:`N=4n+2`, the wave vectors on either side of the positive \\ "
":ref:`Fermi wave number <fermi-wavenumber>` :math:`\\pi/(2a)` of the "
"infinite chain are :math:`\\pi/(2a)\\pm\\pi/(Na)`. Substituting these "
"into Equation :eq:`tb-band` gives :math:`\\Delta_N=4t\\sin(\\pi/N)` for "
"the difference between the highest occupied and lowest unoccupied levels."
" For example, :math:`N=6` gives :math:`2t`. For large :math:`N`, "
":math:`\\Delta_N\\simeq4\\pi t/N`, about twice the gap of an open-ended "
"chain with the same number of atoms."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:137
msgid ""
":math:`N=4n` の場合は :math:`k=\\pm\\pi/(2a)` が許される。この二つの縮退した準位には、 "
"スピンを含む4状態のうち2個分だけ電子が入るため、同じエネルギーに空状態が残り、 ギャップはゼロである。"
msgstr ""
"If :math:`N=4n`, the allowed wave vectors include "
":math:`k=\\pm\\pi/(2a)`. Electrons occupy only two of the four states at "
"these two degenerate levels, counting spin. Empty states thus remain at "
"the same energy and the gap is zero."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:141
msgid ""
":numref:`fig-tightbinding-finite-chain-gaps`\\ では、開放端と、周期境界でギャップが開く場合の "
"点列がどちらもゼロへ近づく。周期境界では、原子数によってギャップが最初からゼロの点もある。 同じ等間隔の鎖でも、ギャップの大きさから "
":math:`t` を見積もる式は境界条件と原子数によって変わる。"
msgstr ""
"In :numref:`fig-tightbinding-finite-chain-gaps`\\ , the gaps approach "
"zero both for open-ended chains and for periodic chains with nonzero "
"gaps. For periodic boundary conditions, some atom counts give a gap that "
"is zero from the outset. Even for the same equally spaced chain, the "
"equation for estimating :math:`t` from the gap depends on the boundary "
"conditions and the number of atoms."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:145
msgid "原子数に対するギャップのグラフ。開放端とNが4n+2の周期鎖ではギャップが減少し、Nが4nの周期鎖ではすべてゼロ。"
msgstr ""
"Gap versus number of atoms. The gap decreases for open-ended chains and "
"for periodic chains with N = 4n + 2. It is zero for every periodic chain "
"with N = 4n."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:151
msgid ""
"等間隔・半充填で原子数が偶数の鎖。丸は開放端（式 :eq:`tb-finite-gap`）、四角は :math:`N=4n+2` の周期鎖、三角は"
" :math:`N=4n` の周期鎖を表す。 線は同じ条件の点を結ぶ目安で、原子数は離散値を取る。"
msgstr ""
"Equally spaced, half-filled chains with an even number of atoms. Circles "
"represent open-ended chains (Equation :eq:`tb-finite-gap`), squares "
"represent periodic chains with :math:`N=4n+2`, and triangles represent "
"periodic chains with :math:`N=4n`. The lines are only guides connecting "
"points for the same conditions. The number of atoms takes discrete "
"values."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:158
msgid "ホッピングが交替する開放端の鎖"
msgstr "Open-Ended Chain with Alternating Hopping"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:160
msgid ""
"\\ :ref:`SSH模型<tb-ssh>`\\ のように隣接する結合の強さが :math:`t_1`、:math:`t_2` と交替すると、 "
"無限鎖でもバンドギャップ :math:`\\Delta_{\\mathrm{SSH}}=2|t_1-t_2|`\\ （式 :eq:`tb-ssh-"
"gap`）が残る。 鎖の内部の周期構造で決まるこのギャップを、端の影響と区別して **バルクのギャップ** と呼ぶ。 原子数 :math:`N` "
"が偶数の開放端の鎖では、両端の結合はどちらも胞内の :math:`t_1` になる。 "
"半充填のHOMO–LUMOギャップは、この端の結合が強いか弱いかで振る舞いが変わる。"
msgstr ""
"When neighboring bond strengths alternate as in the \\ :ref:`SSH model "
"<tb-ssh>`\\ , taking the values :math:`t_1` and :math:`t_2`, the band gap"
" :math:`\\Delta_{\\mathrm{SSH}}=2|t_1-t_2|`\\  (Equation :eq:`tb-ssh-"
"gap`) persists even in an infinite chain. This gap is set by the periodic"
" structure inside the chain and is called the **bulk gap** to distinguish"
" it from end effects. In an open-ended chain with an even number of atoms"
" :math:`N`, both end bonds are intracell bonds of strength :math:`t_1`. "
"At half filling, the behavior of the HOMO–LUMO gap depends on whether "
"these end bonds are strong or weak."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:166
msgid ""
"**端の結合が強い**\\ （:math:`t_1>t_2`）: 準位はバルクのバンドに対応するものだけで、HOMO–LUMOギャップは "
"鎖を長くすると上から :math:`2|t_1-t_2|` に近づく。"
msgstr ""
"**Strong end bonds**\\ (:math:`t_1>t_2`): Only levels corresponding to "
"the bulk bands are present, and the HOMO–LUMO gap approaches "
":math:`2|t_1-t_2|` from above as the chain grows longer."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:168
msgid ""
"**端の結合が弱い**\\ （:math:`t_1<t_2`）: 十分に長い鎖では、バルクのギャップの中央 "
":math:`\\varepsilon_0` 付近に、 両端に局在する二つの準位が現れる。HOMO–LUMOギャップはこの二準位の間隔であり、 "
"原子数を2つ増やすごとにおよそ :math:`t_1/t_2` 倍に縮む。つまり鎖を長くすると指数関数的にゼロに近づく。"
msgstr ""
"**Weak end bonds**\\ (:math:`t_1<t_2`): In a sufficiently long chain, two"
" levels localized at the ends emerge near the center of the bulk gap, "
":math:`\\varepsilon_0`. The HOMO–LUMO gap is the separation between these"
" levels. For every two atoms added, the gap is approximately "
":math:`t_1/t_2` times its previous value, so it approaches zero "
"exponentially as the chain grows longer."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:172
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"例えば :math:`t_1=1.2t,\\ t_2=0.8t` の40原子の鎖ではHOMO–LUMOギャップは約 :math:`0.84t` "
"で、 バルクのギャップ :math:`0.8t` に近い。端を入れ替えた :math:`t_1=0.8t,\\ t_2=1.2t` では約 "
":math:`4\\times10^{-4}t` になる。 "
"したがって、有限鎖の計算でギャップが原子数とともに閉じても、それだけでバルクが金属的とは結論できない。 閉じ方が :math:`1/N` "
"か指数関数的か、閉じずに一定値へ近づくかを見て、 有限サイズギャップ、端の準位、バルクのギャップを区別する。"
msgstr ""
"For example, in a 40-atom chain with :math:`t_1=1.2t,\\ t_2=0.8t`, the "
"HOMO–LUMO gap is about :math:`0.84t`, close to the bulk gap of "
":math:`0.8t`. With the end bonds switched, :math:`t_1=0.8t,\\ t_2=1.2t`, "
"the gap is about :math:`4\\times10^{-4}t`. Thus, a gap that closes as the"
" number of atoms increases in a finite-chain calculation does not by "
"itself establish that the bulk is metallic. To distinguish a finite-size "
"gap, end levels, and a bulk gap, check whether the gap closes as "
":math:`1/N` or exponentially, or approaches a nonzero constant."

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:181
msgid "説明用の事例：水素原子鎖"
msgstr "Worked Example: Hydrogen Atom Chain"

#: ../../solid/finite_chain.rst:183
msgid ""
"`水素原子を並べると電子バンドは生まれるのか <https://example.quloud-"
"platform.quemix.com/hydrogen_chain/band_formation.html>`_ では、原子間隔1.8 "
"Åで等間隔に並べた中性の水素原子鎖 :math:`\\mathrm H_N` を、 STO-"
"3G基底（水素1原子あたり1個の1s型基底関数）で計算している（Psi4 1.10、 "
"原子核位置固定、開放端）。1原子1軌道・半充填という点で、本稿の模型と同じ構成である。 :numref:`tbl-fc-hydrogen-"
"gaps` は、原子数を2倍ずつ変えたときのHOMO–LUMOギャップである。"
msgstr ""
"The calculation example “`Do Electronic Bands Form in a Hydrogen Atom "
"Chain? <https://example.quloud-"
"platform.quemix.com/hydrogen_chain/band_formation.html>`_” uses an "
"equally spaced neutral hydrogen atom chain :math:`\\mathrm H_N` with an "
"interatomic spacing of 1.8 Å and an STO-3G basis (one 1s-type basis "
"function per hydrogen atom). The calculations use Psi4 1.10 with fixed "
"nuclei and open boundary conditions. The setup matches our model in "
"having one orbital per atom and half filling. :numref:`tbl-fc-hydrogen-"
"gaps` gives the HOMO–LUMO gaps as the number of atoms doubles."

